/target

# Verified: running `cargo` from inside a workspace member (server/,
# crates/tree-sitter-jbehave-sys/) still resolves to the workspace-root
# /target above, not a separate one — no per-member entries needed.

# Artifacts Zed generates when you `zed: install dev extension` from this
# repo root: the compiled extension component and the checked-out + compiled
# grammar.
/extension.wasm
/grammars

# The .tar.gz Zed produces if you ever run `zed extension package` locally.
*.tar.gz

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# Local, machine-specific Claude Code settings; not shared project config.
.claude/settings.local.json
